# November 19, 2026: Saratoga County outside the old hotel sites, drawn at random by tools/choose.py (region sar, which
# offered Round Lake and Malta). The region held 17 places, most of them gone hotels in Saratoga Springs and the old
# Champlain Canal locks in Halfmoon. This batch adds what stands and is worth the trip: the Round Lake camp-meeting
# village and its auditorium, the moved lenticular truss bridge on Ruhle Road, Ballston Spa's Brookside inn and Union
# Mill, the gasholder house, the trolley Drink Hall, Yaddo's gardens, the Gideon Putnam burying ground, the Spa park
# bathhouses, the Canfield Casino (replacing the thin lm- pin), Grant Cottage (likewise), the Saratoga battlefield, the
# Schuyler House, the Saratoga Monument and Victory Woods, three Schuylerville and Stillwater buildings, and the
# Copeland covered bridge in Edinburg.
# Sources were opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py); the 2004 Register form for the Ruhle
# Road bridge (historicbridges.org copy); NPS hours, directions and place pages; NYS Parks; the Round Lake Auditorium,
# Brookside Museum, Saratoga Springs History Museum, Grant Cottage and Discover Saratoga visitor-centre pages; the New
# York State Covered Bridge Society; Visit Sacandaga; New York by Rail; CNY Hiking's battlefield tour log.
from data_b import N
from data_ma import W
def L(t,u): return [t,u]
